@startuml pipeline_flow_and_parameters
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontName "Roboto, Noto Sans CJK JP, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam ArrowColor #263238
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

skinparam package {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #78909C
    BorderThickness 1.5
    FontColor #263238
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
    BorderColor #FFB300
    FontColor #263238
}

title **gn10-pointcloud-localization: End-to-End Pipeline & Parameter Reference**\n(Hybrid 3D + 2D LiDAR / GPU ESDF Matcher / Anti-Oscillation Fallback / Safety TF Gating)

start

partition "0. Map Initialization (`setupMapData`)" #ECEFF1 {
    :Load Field Geometry (`nhk2026_map.json` / `.pcd` / `.esdf`)\nand generate 3D ESDF Voxel Grid + Upload to **CUDA 3D Texture (`tex3D`)**;
    note right
        **Map & ESDF Parameters (`esdf.*`)**
        * `map_source_type`: `"json"` | `"pcd"` | `"esdf"`
        * `esdf.resolution`: **0.05 m** (5 cm voxel size)
        * `esdf.max_dist`: **0.50 m** (ESDF distance truncation ceiling)
        * `esdf.crop_enabled`: **true**
        * `esdf.crop_min/max_x`: **[-5.5, 5.5] m**
        * `esdf.crop_min/max_y`: **[-6.0, 6.0] m**
        * `esdf.min_z` / `max_z`: **[-0.20, 4.00] m**
    end note
}

fork
    partition "1A. IMU Stream (`imuCallback` @ 200 Hz)" #E8F5E9 {
        :Receive `/livox/imu` (`sensor_msgs/Imu`);
        :Transform angular velocity to `base_link` (`R_base_imu_`);
        :Trapezoidal yaw integration in `YawHistory` (2.0 s rolling buffer)\nand update `latest_omega_z_`;
    }
fork again
    partition "1B. 2D LiDAR Stream (`scan2dCallback` @ 30 Hz)" #F3E5F5 {
        :Receive `/lakibeam/scan` (`sensor_msgs/LaserScan`);
        :Lookup static TF `base_link <- lakibeam_frame`;
        :Run **`deskewLaserScan`** (Per-beam IMU rotation + linear velocity\ndeskew to scan end timestamp `ref_stamp`, self-filter `r <= robot_radius`);
        :Store `latest_2d_points_` & `latest_2d_stamp_` (`age < 0.20 s`);
        note right
            **2D LiDAR Parameters (`lidar_2d.*`)**
            * `lidar_2d.enable`: **true**
            * `lidar_2d.deskew`: **true** (Rotational + Translational Deskew)
            * `lidar_2d.time_offset_sec`: **0.0 s**
            * `lidar_2d.topic`: `"/lakibeam/scan"`
            * `lidar_2d.frame_id`: `"lakibeam_frame"` (`x=-0.33, y=0.0, z=0.08, yaw=3.13`)
            * `lidar_2d.tf_wait_sec`: **0.05 s**
        end note
    }
fork again
    partition "1C. 3D LiDAR Main Pipeline (`cloudCallback` @ 10-50 Hz)" #E3F2FD {
        :Receive `/livox/lidar` (`sensor_msgs/PointCloud2`);
        :Extract per-point timestamps (`extractRawTimedPoints`)\nand append to rolling window `ScanAccumulator`;
        note right
            **3D Scan Accumulation (`scan_accumulation.*`)**
            * `window_s`: **0.10 s** (100 ms sliding window)
            * `timestamp_field`: `"timestamp"` (`scale = 1e-9`)
            * Reference timestamp `reference_stamp` = newest point timestamp
        end note
    }
end fork

partition "2. Motion Prediction & Spatiotemporal Alignment (`cloudCallback`)" #FFF3E0 {
    :Predict search center `search_base_pose` at `reference_stamp`:\n1. **Yaw**: `last_known_pose_.yaw + yaw_history_.delta(last_match, reference_ns)`\n2. **Translation**: `last_known_pose_.xy + velocity_xy * dt` (when `!is_lost_`);
    :Align 2D LiDAR cloud from `latest_2d_stamp_` to `reference_stamp`\nvia **`alignPointsToTimestamp`** (IMU rotation + local velocity projection);
    :Compute adaptive search window:\n* **Yaw expansion** during fast turns (`|omega_z| > 0.5 rad/s`)\n* **XY expansion** up to 1.5x during high speed (`v >= 2.0 m/s`);
    note right
        **Prediction & Adaptive Window Parameters**
        * `velocity_estimation.enable`: **true** (`window_sec: 0.20`, `min_dt_sec: 0.15`, `max_dt_sec: 0.50`, `max_linear_velocity: 4.0 m/s`, EMA `alpha = 0.6`)
        * `matching_params.dynamic_yaw_expansion`: **true**
        * `matching_params.dynamic_yaw_omega_thresh`: **0.5 rad/s**
        * `matching_params.dynamic_yaw_factor`: **0.15 s**
        * `matching_params.dynamic_yaw_max_range`: **0.40 rad**
    end note
}

partition "3. GPU Deskew, Ground Filter & 2D Fusion (`prepareObstacleCloud`)" #E0F7FA {
    :Upload raw 3D timed points (`d_timed_in_`) & up to **2048** IMU samples (`d_imu_samples_`);
    :Launch **`filterGroundWithDeskewKernel` (CUDA)**:\n1. Static TF `livox_frame -> base_link` (`x=0.25, y=-0.25, z=1.09, pitch=-0.273, roll=3.14159`)\n2. Binary-search IMU quadratic interpolation + velocity deskew (`+/-100 ms` clamp)\n3. Max range filter (`dist <= max_range`)\n4. Robot footprint self-filter (`r <= robot_radius` & `z in [height_min, height_max]`)\n5. Ground / Obstacle split (`z <= ground_z_thresh` -> Ground, else -> 3D Obstacle);
    :Append aligned 2D LiDAR points (`num_2d_obstacles_`) after 3D obstacles (`num_3d_obstacles_`) in `d_obstacle_`;
    note right
        **Filter Parameters (`filter_params.*`)**
        * `max_range`: **12.0 m**
        * `robot_radius`: **0.8 m**
        * `robot_height_min / max`: **[0.0, 1.2] m**
        * `ground_z_thresh`: **0.06 m**
        * `max_points`: **200000**
    end note
}

if (Is Robot Lost? (`is_lost_ == true` and no fresh prior)) then (YES: Global Recovery)
    partition "4A. Global Search Recovery (`GlobalSearcher::search`)" #FFEBEE {
        :Stage 1: Downsample cloud (`downsample_stride = 2`) & evaluate coarse 3D grid\nacross full field (`step_xy = 0.30 m`, `step_yaw = 0.30 rad`);
        :Select **Top-K (`K = 4`)** spatially/angularly separated candidates via **3D NMS**\n(`dist_xy >= 0.60 m` or `diff_yaw >= 0.50 rad`);
        :Stage 2: Run full-resolution multi-level `matchObstacleCloud` around each Top-K peak\nand select candidate with lowest cost;
        note right
            **Global Search Parameters (`global_search.*`)**
            * `range_min/max_x`: **[-5.25, 5.25] m**
            * `range_min/max_y`: **[-5.70, 5.70] m**
            * `range_yaw_diff`: **1.0 rad** (Red/Blue) / **3.1415 rad** (Common)
            * `step_xy`: **0.30 m**, `step_yaw`: **0.30 rad**
            * `downsample_stride`: **2**, `top_k_candidates`: **4**
            * `lost_count_thresh`: **10 frames** (`interval_sec = 0.5 s`)
        end note
    }
else (NO: Local Tracking)
    partition "4B. Local Multi-Resolution ESDF Matching & Anti-Oscillation Fallback (`matchObstacleCloud`)" #E8EAF6 {
        :Compute dynamic 2D weight `w_2d = weight_2d_lidar * min(1.0, N_2d / target_2d_points)`;
        :Run 3-Stage Coarse-to-Fine GPU ESDF Matching (`evaluateESDFKernel` + `cub::DeviceReduce::ArgMin`):\n* **Coarse**: `range_xy = +/-0.30 m` (`step = 0.05 m`), `range_yaw = +/-0.15 rad` (`step = 0.03 rad`)\n* **Fine Level 1 (1/5x)**: `step_xy = 0.01 m`, `step_yaw = 0.006 rad`\n* **Fine Level 2 (1/25x)**: `step_xy = 0.002 m` (2 mm), `step_yaw = 0.0012 rad` (~0.07 deg);
        :Evaluate best pose metrics via `computeBestPoseMetricsESDFKernel`\n(`cost_3d`, `cost_2d`, 3D `inliers`, `inlier_cost`);
        if (Combined match failed 3D (`!pass_3d`) OR Severe 2D spike (`cost_2d >= 2 * cost_threshold_2d`)?) then (YES: Guard 1)
            :Re-run **3D-only (`w_2d = 0.0`)** to isolate 3D pose from corrupted/spiked 2D scan;
            if (3D-only still fails (`!pass_3d`) AND 2D is available?) then (YES: Guard 2)
                :Re-run **2D-only (`w_2d = 1.0`)** within **tight continuity window**\n(`range_xy <= 2 * step_xy = 0.10 m`, `range_yaw <= 2 * step_yaw = 0.06 rad`)\nto maintain tracking without 3D <-> 2D jumping;
            endif
        endif
        :Extract dynamic obstacles (`d >= dynamic_dist_thresh = 0.15 m`) from 3D cloud\nvia `filterDynamicPointsESDFKernel` + `cub::DeviceSelect::Flagged`;
    }
endif

partition "5. Match Acceptance & Safety TF Gating (`isPoseMatchAccepted`)" #FCE4EC {
    if (`pass_3d || pass_2d` satisfied?) then (ACCEPTED)
        :Reset `lost_frame_count_ = 0`, `is_lost_ = false`;
        :Update `last_known_pose_ = best_pose` & update EMA velocity (`velocity_x_`, `velocity_y_`);
        :Broadcast `map -> base_link` TF & publish `/platform_constraint`, `/dynamic_cloud`,\nand `/robot/operation/localization_success = true`;
    else (REJECTED)
        :Increment `lost_frame_count_++` (`if >= lost_count_thresh (10) -> is_lost_ = true`);
        :Publish `/robot/operation/localization_success = false`;
        if (`!is_lost_` AND `lost_frame_count_ <= 2` AND `dt_since_last_match <= 0.10 s`?) then (Transient 1-2 frame drop)
            :Broadcast short-term IMU/velocity predicted TF (`is_predicted = true`);
        else (Continuous failure > 2 frames or LOST)
            :**STOP TF & Pose Publication Immediately**\n(Triggers downstream `path_follower_node` `pose_age` Emergency Stop);
        endif
    endif
    note right
        **Acceptance Thresholds (`matching_params.*`)**
        * **3D Pass (`N_3d >= 50`)**:
          `cost_3d < 0.22 m` **OR**
          (`inliers >= 400` AND `inlier_cost < 0.035 m`
           AND `inlier_ratio >= 0.28` AND `cost_3d < 0.22 m`)
        * **2D Pass (`N_2d >= 30`)**:
          `cost_2d < 0.08 m`
    end note
}

stop
@enduml
